  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search, implemented]

## pages
- label: an empty CommandPalette query lists a Go to group of app pages: Chat (/), Runs (/sessions), Compare, rendered session, and New run
  id: cpgo
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'empty query lists a Go to group of app pages' test/browser/command-palette-nav.test.js test/browser/command-palette.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-nav, implemented]
- label: typing a page name (chat, runs, compare, view, launch) in the CommandPalette filters to that Go to destination
  id: cpgf
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'typing a page name' test/browser/command-palette-nav.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-nav, implemented]
- label: a g/go/goto prefix in the CommandPalette focuses Go to page destinations the way Linear focuses a result class
  id: cpgp
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'go/goto prefix|parsePaletteQuery' test/browser/command-palette-nav.test.js test/browser/command-palette-search.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-nav, implemented]
- label: activating a CommandPalette Go to item navigates to that surface: Chat to /, Runs to /sessions, Compare to /compare, rendered session to /view, New run to the launcher or /?launch=1
  id: cpgn
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'activating a CommandPalette Go to item|navigates to that surface' test/browser/command-palette-nav.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-nav, implemented]
- label: CommandPalette Go to items show G-then-letter shortcut glyphs, and G then C/R/D/V/N jumps to Chat, Runs, Compare, rendered session, or New run when the palette is closed
  id: cpgk
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'G-then-letter|G then C' test/browser/command-palette-nav.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-nav, implemented]
- label: when a run or session is in context, the CommandPalette offers Go to this run at /run?id= or Go to this chat at /run?session=
  id: cpgt
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'Go to this run|Go to this chat' test/browser/command-palette-nav.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-nav, implemented]
- label: CommandPalette Compare and rendered-session destinations use the current or last pair/session so they land on /compare?a=&b= and /view?id= instead of bouncing to /sessions
  id: cpgc
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'Compare and rendered-session destinations|last pair' test/browser/command-palette-nav.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-nav, implemented]

## keyboard
- label: while the CommandPalette combobox is focused, typing / o j k g ? and a normal letter inserts those characters into #cmdkInput
  id: cpkey
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'typing /ojkg.x inserts those characters into #cmdkInput' test/browser/command-palette-key-capture.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, cmdk-key-capture, implemented]
- label: while the CommandPalette is open, slash-to-search, chapter j/k/o, and G-then-letter chords do not steal printable keys from the combobox
  id: cpnos
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'do not steal printable keys from the combobox|ignored while CommandPalette is open' test/browser/command-palette-key-capture.test.js test/render/render-interactions-nav.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, cmdk-key-capture, implemented]
- label: CommandPalette printable-key capture holds on every served surface that mounts the palette: /sessions, /run, /view, /compare, and chat home
  id: cpsrf
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'printable-key capture holds for CommandPalette on|open CommandPalette types' test/browser/command-palette-key-capture.test.js test/browser/command-palette.playwright.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, cmdk-key-capture, implemented]
- label: while the CommandPalette combobox is focused, unmodified printable keydown is not stopPropagationed on #cmdkInput or #cmdkOverlay; GitHub keyDownHandler returns on isFormField(event.target) and / o j k g ? x insert into the combobox
  id: cpdisp
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "GitHub keyDownHandler return is enough|stopPageShortcutsForPrintable is gone" test/browser/command-palette-key-capture.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, cmdk-key-capture, implemented]
- label: Playwright Cmd+K then type /ojkg?x inserts those characters into #cmdkInput; first-key / and o insert; #workspaceSearch is not focused
  id: cppw
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "open CommandPalette types|first-key / and o insert" test/browser/command-palette.playwright.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, cmdk-key-capture, implemented]
- label: while the CommandPalette is open, unmodified printable keydown including / o and /ojkg?x inserts into #cmdkInput by native browser editing; capture-phase onGlobalKey does not inspect key.length === 1 or re-focus the combobox for those keys
  id: cpnative
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "onGlobalKey does not inspect key.length === 1|native insertion types" test/browser/command-palette-key-capture.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, cmdk-key-capture, implemented]

