# search
- label: typing in the CommandPalette filters Go to and in-view commands without waiting for /api/search
  id: cpfast
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'does not wait for /api/search before listing commands' test/browser/command-palette-search.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search, implemented]
- label: a CommandPalette query fetches GET /api/search with limit=8 and snippets=0 so session hits populate from the SearchIndex without waiting on a 50-hit on-disk snippet scan
  id: cplim
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "palette search uses limit=8 and snippets=0|limit=8&snippets=0" test/browser/command-palette-search.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search-latency, implemented]
- label: GET /api/search honors limit (1-50, default 50) and snippets=0: searchSessions then ranks from the SearchIndex and uses firstPrompt matches without scanSessionForQuery
  id: cpidx
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "GET /api/search honors limit and snippets=0|searchSessions snippets:false skips disk scans" test/route-handlers-api.test.js test/sessions/scan-queries.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search-latency, implemented]
- label: GET /api/search?catalog=1 returns compact session identities (id, source, prompt, model, project, tools) from the metadata index without scanSessionForQuery
  id: cpcat
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "GET /api/search catalog=1 returns compact session identities" test/route-handlers-api.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search-latency, implemented]
- label: CommandPalette preloads GET /api/search?catalog=1 and ranks typed session hits locally so the first .cmdk-hit does not wait on a 50-hit snippet scan or the 80ms search debounce
  id: cploc
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "palette preloads the search catalog and ranks typed session hits locally" test/browser/command-palette-search.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search-latency, implemented]
- label: local catalog ranking matches tool names and firstPrompt so a query like Read yields pickable source/id/prompt hits
  id: cpread
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "catalog ranking matches tool names and Read yields pickable hits" test/browser/command-palette-search.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search-latency, implemented]
- label: served CommandPalette pages embed the identity catalog in #tq-cmdk-catalog so the first typed key ranks locally without waiting on GET /api/search?catalog=1
  id: cphtml
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "served pages embed the identity catalog|injectSearchCatalog embeds" test/browser/command-palette-search.test.js test/routes/route-handlers-pages.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search-latency, implemented]
- label: CommandPalette seeds catalogCache from #tq-cmdk-catalog at boot with pickable source/id/prompt identity and does not fetch GET /api/search?catalog=1 when the page catalog is present
  id: cpseed
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "seeds catalogCache from #tq-cmdk-catalog|unpackSearchCatalog restores pickable identity" test/browser/command-palette-search.test.js
  tags: [spec, command-palette, palette-search-latency, implemented]
